     "difficulty": "hard_hots",
     "question": "Read the table carefully. 1. Copper vessel exposed to moist air -&gt; Green coating -&gt; Turns red litmus solution blue 2. Aluminium foil dipped in fresh solution of sodium hydroxide -&gt; Colourless, odourless gas -&gt; Burns with a pop sound 3. Rusting of iron -&gt; Reddish brown deposit -&gt; Turns red litmus solution blue 4. Burning of sulphur powder -&gt; Colourless, suffocating gas -&gt; Turns blue litmus solution red Identify the products formed and their nature.",
