     "options": [],
     "answer": "Working: Carries: 1 1 1 1 1 1 (= 7 in decimal) + 1 1 1 (= 7 in decimal) --------- 1 1 1 0 (= 14 in decimal) Column-by-column: - Column 1: 1 + 1 = 0 with carry 1. - Column 2: 1 (carry) + 1 + 1 = 11 (sum 1 with carry 1). - Column 3: 1 (carry) + 1 + 1 = 11 (sum 1 with carry 1). - Column 4: 1 (carry) = 1. Result: (111)₂ + (111)₂ = (1110)₂ = 14 in decimal.",
     "explanation": "In binary, 1 + 1 + 1 equals decimal 3, which is 11 in binary (sum bit 1, carry bit 1)."
