     "question": "Distinguish clearly between Distance and Displacement.",
     "options": [],
     "answer": "DistanceDisplacementTotal path length covered (Scalar).Shortest straight-line distance from start to end (Vector).Always positive ($d > 0$ for moving bodies).Can be positive, negative, or zero.Does not decrease with time.Can decrease if body returns towards start.",
