     "type": "short_answer",
     "marks": 3,
     "difficulty": "medium",
     "question": "The odometer of a car reads 57321.0 km at 08:30 AM. At 08:50 AM, the odometer reads 57336.0 km. Find speed in km/min and km/h.",
     "options": [],
     "answer": "Distance covered $\\Delta s = 57336.0 - 57321.0 = 15.0\\text{ km}$.Time taken $\\Delta t = 20\\text{ min} = \\frac{1}{3}\\text{ h}$.$\\text{Speed in km/min} = \\frac{15\\text{ km}}{20\\text{ min}} = 0.75\\text{ km/min}$.$\\text{Speed in km/h} = \\frac{15\\text{ km}}{1/3\\text{ h}} = 45\\text{ km/h}$.",
