     "type": "short_answer",
     "marks": 2,
     "difficulty": "medium",
     "question": "standard textbook Q1: Calculate speed of car that travels 150 metres in 10 seconds. Express answer in km/h.",
     "options": [],
     "answer": "Speed in m/s = $\\frac{150\\text{ m}}{10\\text{ s}} = 15\\text{ m/s}$.Speed in km/h = $15 \\times \\frac{18}{5} = 54\\text{ km/h}$.",
