     "question": "In a $2 \\times 2$ calendar grid of dates $\\begin{bmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\end{bmatrix}$, if $a$ is the top-left date, what is the sum of the two diagonal pairs $(a + d)$ and $(b + c)$?",
