     "question": "Illustration 12 (Textbook p. 112): In the given figure, $AB \\parallel CD$, $\\angle CDM = 150^\\circ$, $\\angle BMD = 64^\\circ$, and $\\angle ABM = x$. Find the value of $x$.",
